""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/377-xanandithras","name":"Xanandithras","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar377_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"427"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-08T08:04:19-07:00","id":1148006,"title":"","content":"Oh, I've seen this artist in thr Kindred of the East. These designs remind me of Satyrs in Warcraft.<br /> <br /> Surprisingly, the image I have identified with Firbolg the most is on the cover for Changeling: the Lost's &quot;Autumn Nightmares&quot;. Daedric Prince Hircine kind of vibe, you know.<br /> <br /> Not necessary chaotic evil, but definitely predatory and dangerous. They might look savage, but are inhumanely intelligent.While Adhene are divided and different Dark Kins aren't in any kind of social relationship, I feel, like Firbolg might have a best shot at being Sidhe's counterpart.<br /> <br /> That's why I think that S(e)vart Alfar is a 'meh' idea, btw.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/12/140472.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">J. P. Targete</a> (<a href=\"https://vignette.wikia.nocookie.net/whitewolf/images/2/2e/Ctlautumnnightmares.png\" target=\"_blank\">Autumn Nightmares</a>)<br /> Also <a href=\"https://mr--jack.deviantart.com/art/Two-Hunters-148908053\" target=\"_blank\">Two Hunters</a>. Though I guess, it would be har- impossible to find a decent female Firbolg art, aside that one (<b>UPD:</b> two, it's kinda easy to miss there's two characters on the first illustration - she almost blends in) you've just posted. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> And less said about character splats in C20 the better.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>...","edited":{"userid":5211,"user_link":"https